      "writtenOn": "2022-09-13T01:33:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi todd,\nCurrently, this vendor hook is only used by our vendor. \nAnalysis from the current code: When err\u003d1 （line 1511）, if (err \u003c 0)（line 1524） will execute free card.\nIf not modified, it will affect the use of HS SD cards by other manufacturers.",
      "parentUuid": "139a785d_1460686e",
      "revId": "4a31a8dc5f1faf0ca255b8069f80e7db5151e4ed",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e42e4495_2304ff3c",
        "filename": "drivers/mmc/core/sd.c",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 1524,
